<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<%- include('partials/head') %>
<body>

  <%- include('partials/header') %>

  <!-- Hero Section -->
  <section class="section-padding bg-soft-gradient position-relative overflow-hidden text-center">
    <div class="backdrop-glow"></div>
    <div class="container position-relative z-3">
      <div class="max-width-800 mx-auto">
        <span class="badge-category mb-3">Learn the Journey</span>
        <h1 class="display-5 fw-extrabold mb-4" style="color: #182033;">
          Simple, Straightforward and <span class="text-primary-blue">Private.</span>
        </h1>
        <p class="lead text-muted mb-0">
          We want your experience to be as stress-free as possible. Read below to understand how the platform works and how credits are managed.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Detailed Step Process Section -->
  <section class="section-padding bg-white border-divider">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row align-items-center g-5">
        <div class="col-lg-6">
          <h2 class="fw-bold mb-4">The User Journey</h2>
          
          <div class="d-flex gap-4 mb-4">
            <div class="d-flex flex-column align-items-center">
              <div class="step-number" style="margin: 0; width: 44px; height: 44px;">1</div>
              <div style="width: 2px; flex-grow: 1; background-color: #E2E8F0; margin-top: 8px;"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="pb-3">
              <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark">Create Account</h5>
              <p class="text-muted">Sign up securely with your mobile number. We respect your anonymity; choose any name you feel comfortable using.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="d-flex gap-4 mb-4">
            <div class="d-flex flex-column align-items-center">
              <div class="step-number" style="margin: 0; width: 44px; height: 44px;">2</div>
              <div style="width: 2px; flex-grow: 1; background-color: #E2E8F0; margin-top: 8px;"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="pb-3">
              <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark">Top Up Wallet</h5>
              <p class="text-muted">Purchase credit packs directly through the dashboard. Credits represent available call minutes inside your dashboard.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="d-flex gap-4 mb-4">
            <div class="d-flex flex-column align-items-center">
              <div class="step-number" style="margin: 0; width: 44px; height: 44px;">3</div>
              <div style="width: 2px; flex-grow: 1; background-color: #E2E8F0; margin-top: 8px;"></div>
            </div>
            <div class="pb-3">
              <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark">Start Call Simulator</h5>
              <p class="text-muted">Click the "Start Voice Call" widget. The platform connects you with my line securely via voice call technology.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="d-flex gap-4">
            <div class="d-flex flex-column align-items-center">
              <div class="step-number" style="margin: 0; width: 44px; height: 44px;">4</div>
            </div>
            <div>
              <h5 class="fw-bold text-dark">Deduct & End</h5>
              <p class="text-muted">Credits are deducted automatically as minutes tick. If your credits run low, you'll receive a subtle notification so you can recharge or close the conversation.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="col-lg-6 text-center">
          <div class="card-premium bg-light p-4 border-0">
            <h4 class="fw-bold mb-4">Visual Credit Flow</h4>
            <svg class="w-100" height="280" viewBox="0 0 400 280" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
              <rect x="20" y="20" width="140" height="60" rx="8" fill="#EEF6FF" stroke="#1769E0" stroke-width="1.5"/>
              <text x="90" y="55" fill="#182033" font-weight="600" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle">1. Purchase Credits</text>
              
              <rect x="240" y="20" width="140" height="60" rx="8" fill="#F5F1FF" stroke="#7B4DCE" stroke-width="1.5"/>
              <text x="310" y="55" fill="#182033" font-weight="600" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle">2. Added to Wallet</text>
              
              <rect x="240" y="160" width="140" height="60" rx="8" fill="#FFF5FA" stroke="#E91E8F" stroke-width="1.5"/>
              <text x="310" y="195" fill="#182033" font-weight="600" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle">3. Call Deducts (1m=1c)</text>
              
              <rect x="20" y="160" width="140" height="60" rx="8" fill="#FAFAFD" stroke="#667085" stroke-width="1.5"/>
              <text x="90" y="195" fill="#182033" font-weight="600" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle">4. Call Finishes</text>

              <path d="M160 50 H240" stroke="#1769E0" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/>
              <path d="M310 80 V160" stroke="#7B4DCE" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/>
              <path d="M240 190 H160" stroke="#E91E8F" stroke-width="2" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/>
              <path d="M90 160 V80" stroke="#667085" stroke-width="2" stroke-dasharray="4 4" marker-end="url(#arrow)"/>

              <defs>
                <marker id="arrow" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="6" refY="5" markerWidth="6" markerHeight="6" orient="auto-start-reverse">
                  <path d="M 0 0 L 10 5 L 0 10 z" fill="#182033"/>
                </marker>
              </defs>
            </svg>
            <div class="alert alert-secondary text-start small mb-0 mt-3 border-0 bg-white">
              <i class="bi bi-info-circle-fill text-primary-blue me-2"></i> 
              Unused credits do not expire and will remain safely stored in your balance for future calls.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Tips section -->
  <section class="section-padding bg-light">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="max-width-800 mx-auto text-center mb-5">
        <h2 class="fw-bold">How to Prepare For Your Call</h2>
        <p class="text-muted">A supportive conversation works best when you feel comfortable. Here are a few simple tips to help you prepare.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="row g-4">
        <div class="col-md-4">
          <div class="card-premium h-100 bg-white border-0">
            <h5 class="fw-bold text-primary-blue mb-3"><i class="bi bi-volume-mute me-2"></i> Find a Quiet Space</h5>
            <p class="text-muted mb-0 small">Choose a room or location where you feel comfortable speaking out loud without worrying about others hearing you.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4">
          <div class="card-premium h-100 bg-white border-0">
            <h5 class="fw-bold text-purple mb-3"><i class="bi bi-pencil-square me-2"></i> Note Down Thoughts</h5>
            <p class="text-muted mb-0 small">If you are feeling anxious, it can help to write down a couple of keywords or thoughts you wish to share before calling.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="col-md-4">
          <div class="card-premium h-100 bg-white border-0">
            <h5 class="fw-bold text-primary-pink mb-3"><i class="bi bi-chat-heart me-2"></i> Speak Honestly</h5>
            <p class="text-muted mb-0 small">There is no expectation for you to sound eloquent. Take your time, stutter if you need to, and share only what you feel ready to.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <%- include('partials/footer') %>
  <%- include('partials/scripts') %>
</body>
</html>
